requirements.requirement:
Tooling may contain stable templates such as:

```text
https://www.nuget.org/packages/{packageId}/{version}
https://github.com/{owner}/{repo}/releases/tag/v{version}
```

Inserted identifiers/version values must come from canonical sources.

Create:

```text
docs/release-state.json
```

Preferred initial structure:

```json
{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "publicVersion": "14.0.0",
  "library": {
    "nugetPublished": true
  },
  "cli": {
    "nugetPublished": false,
    "githubReleasePublished": true
  }
}
```

Keep this intentionally small.
